{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Farol del Diablo&quot; is a horror game set in Loma Quebrada, an Argentine town shrouded in darkness and legend. Armed with only a flashlight and limited resources, Catalina, our protagonist, embarks on a quest for valuable objects despite the rumors of the Luz Mala guarding the town. You must uncover what happened there before the night consumes you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark atmosphere and oppressive ambient sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and talk to the townspeople to uncover the dreadful truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect the treasures protected by the Luz Mala.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Biting the sheath of a knife might save your life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your flashlight will be your best companion\u2014keep it bright.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person camera control for greater immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player will be defenseless against danger.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544060?t=1745522247","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544060?t=1745522247","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544060/5aae8100c73b67c625b748d7bb243f39a93e0d76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745522247","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544060/5aae8100c73b67c625b748d7bb243f39a93e0d76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745522247","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Farol del Diablo&quot; is a horror game set in Loma Quebrada, an Argentine to